-- A pipe from the ground up, leaving a gap above it.
--
-- The gap is drawn, not computed. Rows 13 to 16 are clear in every chunk of the
-- vocabulary, so however the stream orders them there is a way through — and
-- four rows is the whole difficulty budget of the game, because the bird bobs
-- about one row per flap and has to be flown to stay inside them.

tile #  pipe   solid  pipe.svg
tile _  ground solid  ground.svg
tile o  cloud         cloud.svg
tile .  sky           sky.svg

